Lootborne Planner (formerly Lootborne Companion)

The visual design (palette, card / kpi / pill / chip / switch grammar, grouped side menu) follows
our own BotFarm Planner panel (Documents/BotFarmPlanner/bfapi/painel).
The main-process tap structure (attach loop, silence watchdog, detach timeout) was inspired by
Bomb Farm Companion (https://github.com/lucasfevi/bombfarm-companion, Apache-2.0).

Lootborne is a game by Turbolento Games. This project is an unofficial fan tool and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Turbolento Games or Valve.
